# MoE-Gen — ODS integration analysis

## Executive summary

MoE-Gen focuses on efficient single-GPU MoE execution through scheduling and module/expert batching rather than primarily solving model storage.

**ODS classification: P2.**

## ODS fit

MoE-Gen is most relevant to throughput optimization. Its scheduling and batching ideas can complement storage-oriented strategies such as expert offload and streaming.

It should be considered a capability or optimization layer rather than the first MoE backend for low-VRAM ODS systems.